    "E0": {
      "definition": "F + D <= Gamma (every token served every step)",
      "exit_theorem": "PERMANENT exit once D > Gamma: D = |X| is nondecreasing, so F + D >= D > Gamma forever. (E0 can also fail transiently through F while D <= Gamma; the permanent-exit criterion is D > Gamma.) Exact exit/entry distributions per registered point in the certificates.",
